{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"396827a5f5e891c8","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"1c2d3513068945d0","title":"就是程序员自己控制内存的分配和释放。程序员控制的是堆区的内存。所以我们需要知道堆区数据的特点<br>栈区数据的特点。&nbsp;有对比，才知道为什么这么选"},{"parent":"396827a5f5e891c8","children":[{"parent":"148c0c1eab8238fd","children":[{"parent":"d8fbe70fa6f0204e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b9fe1fba6a51b128","title":"小"},{"parent":"d8fbe70fa6f0204e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5e9bd8adb4492c2a","title":"编译期需要确定大小"},{"parent":"d8fbe70fa6f0204e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6b0e35429c887049","title":"生命周期不够长"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d8fbe70fa6f0204e","title":"缺点"},{"parent":"148c0c1eab8238fd","children":[{"parent":"b3ab6e96b8705a91","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c90c4a845dd25f20","title":"使用简单、高效"},{"parent":"b3ab6e96b8705a91","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"71286a8816d90cab","title":"自动管理内存"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b3ab6e96b8705a91","title":"优点"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"148c0c1eab8238fd","title":"栈区特点"},{"parent":"396827a5f5e891c8","children":[{"parent":"8bc8555df31494c4","children":[{"parent":"ac99f921247d7318","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4714f3881bf676ab","title":"大"},{"parent":"ac99f921247d7318","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"88864dbb2380df5c","title":"可以运行时确定大小"},{"parent":"ac99f921247d7318","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"018077db1c77b552","title":"生命周期可以自己控制（想申请时候申请，想释放时候释放）"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ac99f921247d7318","title":"优点"},{"parent":"8bc8555df31494c4","children":[{"parent":"09ac3af443705c9e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"25db921f7490e542","title":"使用麻烦。（申请、释放&nbsp;稍不小心就会程序崩溃）"},{"parent":"09ac3af443705c9e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dabeaf3dfed1fe14","title":"效率没那么高"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"09ac3af443705c9e","title":"缺点"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8bc8555df31494c4","title":"堆区特点"},{"parent":"396827a5f5e891c8","children":[{"parent":"fc1200177ec8f14e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a0b1689e0761418b","title":"建议优先选择栈区内存"},{"parent":"fc1200177ec8f14e","children":[{"parent":"0fc89ed98df87dc5","children":[],"id":"c0ca2c8420bef390","title":"使用大内存"},{"parent":"0fc89ed98df87dc5","children":[],"id":"685bcc53450f8605","title":"编译期无法确定大小"},{"parent":"0fc89ed98df87dc5","children":[],"id":"beb3335b0d9d1e8e","title":"生命周期需要够长"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0fc89ed98df87dc5","title":"栈区内存无法满足需求，再使用堆区"},{"parent":"fc1200177ec8f14e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5ad726e7ed87b641","title":"数据段是最后的选择，但用的很少"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"fc1200177ec8f14e","title":"内存使用建议"},{"parent":"396827a5f5e891c8","children":[{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[{"parent":"e5899f08a8f03fc2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"57f06a4fa1f5c3fe","title":"void *"},{"parent":"e5899f08a8f03fc2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9adb036b70f9a8e8","title":"可以用这个类型指向任意类型。其实就是存下地址"},{"parent":"e5899f08a8f03fc2","children":[{"parent":"dafb6cbf07e46de4","children":[],"id":"7aa0cbcc85f0c801","title":"int *p_int = &amp;num;<br>"},{"parent":"dafb6cbf07e46de4","children":[],"id":"26e11295e0523335","title":"只能用来存地址。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dafb6cbf07e46de4","title":"但是这个void *&nbsp;不能解引用，不能算术加减"},{"parent":"e5899f08a8f03fc2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c533abcd96008115","title":"使用它之前，必须将其转换为正确的指针类型，才能解引用和算术加减"},{"parent":"e5899f08a8f03fc2","children":[],"id":"82f0e113a1c7a59d","title":"平常的时候，&nbsp;通用指针数据类型能用，特定的指针数据类型能用。&nbsp;<br>优先用特定的，因为即使用通用的，也得转换为特定的指针数据类型才能用"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e5899f08a8f03fc2","title":"通用指针数据类型"},{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"898a11e42f677624","title":"malloc/calloc/realloc/free<br>需要包含头文件 stdlib.h"},{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[{"parent":"8b72121a97a5480f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a100a3b17a1304b8","title":"void* malloc(size_t size);<br>在堆区申请size个字节"},{"parent":"8b72121a97a5480f","children":[{"parent":"a353e07a43c7ceae","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a79285635a8447e7","title":"返回值有两种可能，NULL，或者一个地址"},{"parent":"a353e07a43c7ceae","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"836d5988e71905be","title":"如果内存申请失败的时候，返回NULL"},{"parent":"a353e07a43c7ceae","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3b7ba2f907f2e7e6","title":"如果内存申请成功，返回首字节指针"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a353e07a43c7ceae","title":"返回的是一个通用指针数据类型"},{"parent":"8b72121a97a5480f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"435a3536e2e351d9","title":"最大的一个特点就是malloc返回的数据不会帮忙初始化，也就是我们认为里面的值是随机值。&nbsp;所以在使用之前一定要进行初始化才能使用"},{"parent":"8b72121a97a5480f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ccede7e759df4640","title":"系统不关心底层数据是什么，&nbsp;分配20个字节就是20个字节。只有程序员需要关心&nbsp;<br>int *<br>char *<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8b72121a97a5480f","title":"malloc"},{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[{"parent":"73453d78bea3121c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a5ef35fb905608e5","title":"如果光申请，不释放。内存肯定会耗完。<br>这个就叫内存泄露。&nbsp;使用完成之后，需要释放"},{"parent":"73453d78bea3121c","children":[{"parent":"20156bd8cb64b8f9","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b936f2d271d54cbd","title":"申请内存，在使用完成之后。忘记了释放，这个就会导致本来可以被继续利用的内容，无法被别人使用，这个就叫做内存泄露<br>"},{"parent":"20156bd8cb64b8f9","children":[],"id":"0653cc8c5fe391dc","title":"泄露的解决方案是改进代码，用完要释放"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"20156bd8cb64b8f9","title":"内存泄露"},{"parent":"73453d78bea3121c","children":[{"parent":"b3909a3edf60db4b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e20b0e9d2081e6d9","title":"在程序里本来就有这么多需要使用到的内存。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"b3909a3edf60db4b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c893d43f3297c474","title":"这个只能加硬件"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b3909a3edf60db4b","title":"内存溢出"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"73453d78bea3121c","title":"内存泄露"},{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[{"parent":"5728609de339ab0d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"915474dade26b6cd","title":"void free(void *ptr);<br>将传入的指针指向的内存进行释放"},{"parent":"5728609de339ab0d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"feaf61989aeb141b","title":"参数必须是堆上申请内存块的地址(首字节地址)，不能传递别的指针，否则会引发未定义行为。<br>"},{"parent":"5728609de339ab0d","children":[{"parent":"16ab826a87217ce4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"87f4b3984d35002c","title":"一定要传入原始的指针，也就是指针如果移动了，再传进去，这里就会报错<br>如果确实要挪，弄一个副本存一下。最后传递副本进去。&nbsp;谁不挪就传谁进去"},{"parent":"16ab826a87217ce4","children":[{"parent":"801e92d88ad84f9c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dddd9544dad62324","title":"分工要明确"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"801e92d88ad84f9c","title":"不要double&nbsp;free"},{"parent":"16ab826a87217ce4","children":[{"parent":"68c04cf720c29f4f","children":[],"id":"e77f34a24588963e","title":"int *p_int = malloc(10);<br><br>// if<br><br>free(p_int);<br>//&nbsp;不希望出现这种情况<br>*p_int = 10;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"68c04cf720c29f4f","children":[],"id":"a089efc91beb3538","title":"一旦一个指针用完（free）之后。&nbsp;建议将它的值置为NULL<br>free(p_int);<br>p_int = NULL;<br>//&nbsp;<br>*p_int = 10;<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"68c04cf720c29f4f","title":"悬空指针的问题"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"16ab826a87217ce4","title":"使用free一些需要注意的问题"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5728609de339ab0d","title":"free"},{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[{"parent":"521b566cb6ed15b2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"37e4000524b70e4d","title":"在堆上申请内存，<br>void* calloc(size_t num, size_t size);<br>申请多少个内存，单个内存占多大。"},{"parent":"521b566cb6ed15b2","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"178a2969684c7f1a","title":"calloc申请的内存，会初始化为0值"},{"parent":"521b566cb6ed15b2","children":[],"id":"57374d1e7d998890","title":"其他使用基本和malloc没有区别"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"521b566cb6ed15b2","title":"calloc"},{"parent":"4c2686edf08f084f","children":[{"parent":"ca4fa569311802c9","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b54311e488df1de7","title":"将申请到的内存，重分配。&nbsp;需要将之前获得的内存，增大一点，或者减小一点<br>void* realloc(void* ptr, size_t new_size);<br>"},{"parent":"ca4fa569311802c9","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"ce539b680616d075","title":"这个new_size是重分配之后的内存的字节数。&nbsp;<br>一定不要理解成了元素的个数。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"ca4fa569311802c9","children":[{"parent":"00553e6b45226207","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dbc5aac1e67ff3bc","title":"realloc重分配的时候。如果之前是40个字节，现在是60个字节。&nbsp;<br>对于系统，这时候，有两种可能，一种是在原地给大家扩容<br>有另外一种可能，重新找一个新地方，把原来的数据拷贝过来。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"00553e6b45226207","title":"重分配时候的细节问题"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ca4fa569311802c9","title":"realloc"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4c2686edf08f084f","title":"内存分配函数"},{"parent":"396827a5f5e891c8","children":[{"parent":"4c30b573cfb3a59e","children":[{"parent":"85c60fb0033365f6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b394c6254060adfb","title":"其实它只是底层使用了堆上的连续空间，刚开始够装，等到后面不够装的时候。&nbsp;<br>这时候采取扩容策略"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"85c60fb0033365f6","title":"长度可变的 \"数组\""},{"parent":"4c30b573cfb3a59e","children":[{"parent":"ef347dd1cf7e11f8","children":[{"parent":"ea576acf9b17852b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a794a1b37ce7d345","title":"装函数声明"},{"parent":"ea576acf9b17852b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d13e5552e2579a28","title":"结构体定义"},{"parent":"ea576acf9b17852b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9e2faf7897e3f5cd","title":"类型别名"},{"parent":"ea576acf9b17852b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9dd0f2b9ae868703","title":"宏定义"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ea576acf9b17852b","title":"干什么的"},{"parent":"ef347dd1cf7e11f8","children":[{"parent":"d1644f6ba0d8060a","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"a9966291ba68761a","title":"就是为了保证，一个头文件如果被直接或间接的包含了多次。<br>&nbsp;这时候代码也能正常运行"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d1644f6ba0d8060a","title":"头文件保护性语法"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"ef347dd1cf7e11f8","title":"头文件"},{"parent":"4c30b573cfb3a59e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c65ca9178db457af","title":"一定要注意。&nbsp;到底是谁在底层装数据<br>vector存数据<br>还是vector-&gt;table存数据？<br>扩容的时候，应该扩容table。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4c30b573cfb3a59e","title":"Vector"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"396827a5f5e891c8","title":"动态内存分配"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"a1e11063f8b60d80","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"121eaaee99b462ed","title":"指针是指向某一个变量的。想修改int，可以传入int *来修改它。<br>如果想修改指针的指向呢？&nbsp;<br>这时候需要二级指针"},{"parent":"a1e11063f8b60d80","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"75ba6c9a2f7100a5","title":"一级指针，是指向某个数据的。&nbsp;<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a1e11063f8b60d80","title":"二级指针"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"81a5d91713e53194","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"36d38689a9c958b0","title":"函数指针，就是一个指针指向代码段上的某一片内存"},{"parent":"81a5d91713e53194","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"809cdbfac9716e70","title":"我们传递这个指针，近似于传递一个函数"},{"parent":"81a5d91713e53194","children":[{"parent":"7d01134f4af0a3de","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"630a331f70fe7ced","title":"什么叫大什么叫小。&nbsp;<br>函数指针&nbsp; &nbsp;指向了某个函数"},{"parent":"7d01134f4af0a3de","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7293f1c82b36a642","title":"函数指针的一个应用"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7d01134f4af0a3de","title":"qsort"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"81a5d91713e53194","title":"函数指针"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"root","title":"指针高级","version":534,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:56","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}